{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nMetz is grey and damp, though the Moselle from the ramparts is enough to make a man forget the sleet. I walked the perimeter before dinner; the cathedral is grand but cold from the outside. I dined at the *Hôtel de la Poste*—the duck was overcooked, the wine passable, and I paid six francs for the privilege of being cold.\n\nIn the evening, I attended the theatre. The house was full of garrison officers, loud and smelling of tobacco, which made the *vaudeville* a farce of noise. I watched them more than the play; a certain Colonel, red-faced and blustering, seemed to think his applause could alter the script. It was tiresome.\n\nI have secured a front coupé seat for tomorrow’s diligence to Paris. It will be a long drive, and I shall need my snuff.\n\nHow are the boys? I trust Ludwig is behaving in his studies. I miss your quiet company and the smell of our library more than I care to admit.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795219384,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":232,"prompt_tokens":1120,"total_tokens":1352,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-OG3ELEQcpgooKZOFFEqkVGOXzFQURHr8","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1120,"prompt_ms":1115.005,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9955401785714286,"prompt_per_second":1004.479800539011,"predicted_n":232,"predicted_ms":5550.781,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.029354978354977,"predicted_per_second":41.61576542111822}}